::: {.cell-output-display}
![Changes (units/year) in predicted cold stress for JPB across the CONUS over the entire 44-year period (1981–2025). Maps show (A) all changes and (B) statistically significant changes (P < 0.1); areas shown in gray are not statistically significant. Areas shown as 0 in (B) had significant trends but very small changes.](./JPB/figure5.png){#fig-jpb-cold-stress fig-align='center' width=70%}
:::
:::



